<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n116471" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠφέλ-ημα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a useful</i> or <i>serviceable thing, service, benefit,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				251
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνθρώποισιν ὠφελήματα</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				501
			</span></i>; of a person, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦ κοινὸν ὠφέλημα
				θνητοῖσιν φανείς</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				613
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				703
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠφελήματα</span>
			<i>things good in themselves,</i> e.g. harmony, goodwill, opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐχρηστήματα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Stoic.</u>
				3.23
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				136
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> generally,
				<i>use, advantage, profit,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί δῆτα δόξης . . ὠ. γίγνεται;</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					259
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Hier.</u>
				10.3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠφελήματα πατρίδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ages.</u>
					7.2
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
